sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant C as Studio Client
    participant A as Application
    participant D as Domain Transition
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant O as Outbox
    participant R as Realtime/Projection

    U->>C: Edit model in private draft
    C->>C: Apply command and undo history
    U->>C: Review and commit with reason
    C->>A: CommitChangeSet(expected revision, operations)
    A->>A: Authenticate and authorize
    A->>P: Load scoped current model
    A->>D: Validate and attempt transition
    alt invalid or conflict
        D-->>A: Semantic findings/conflicts
        A-->>C: Invalid or Conflict
        C-->>U: Explain and offer repair/rebase
    else accepted
        D-->>A: New revision, state, events, impact
        A->>P: Atomic current state + history + outbox
        P-->>A: Committed
        A-->>C: Committed revision
        O->>R: Dispatch committed outcome
        R-->>C: Change/projection notification
        C-->>U: Updated model and findings
    end
